=== Sky JSON Examples ===

1. Simple encoding:
{
  "name": "Alice",
  "age": 30,
  "active": true
}

2. Complex encoding:
{
  "user": {
    "name": "Bob",
    "email": "bob@example.com",
    "age": 25
  },
  "tags": [
    "admin",
    "premium"
  ],
  "scores": [
    95,
    87,
    92
  ]
}

3. Simple decoding (map2):
Charlie, age 28

4. Pipeline decoding:
Diana (diana@example.com)

5. Optional fields:
@skydev, bio: No bio provided, followers: 42

6. Nested at:
Eve from London

7. List of objects:
Buy milk, Write Sky

8. Roundtrip:
Count: 3, Names: Alice, Bob, Charlie

9. oneOf (flexible):
42 and hello

10. Result.map3 (heterogeneous combine):
OK: Alice, age 30

11. Result.combine (homogeneous list):
OK ages: 25, 30, 42

12. Result.traverse:
Sum of ages: 90
Done!
